<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Redefinição de senha – VERACIS</title>
    <style type="text/css">
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rawline:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');
    </style>
    <style type="text/css" media="all">
        @media only screen and (max-width: 640px) {
            .ms-header  { display: none !important; }
            .ms-content { width: 100% !important; border-radius: 0 !important; }
            .ms-body    { padding: 28px 24px !important; }
            .ms-footer  { width: 100% !important; }
            .mobile-wide { width: 100% !important; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="font-family:'Rawline','Inter',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;background-color:#F5F2EC;color:#333333;">

<div style="display:none !important;visibility:hidden;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;">Você pediu para trocar sua senha do VERACIS. Clique para criar uma nova senha. Válido por {{redirectUrl}}.</div>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;background-color:#F5F2EC;">
<tr><td align="center">

    <table class="ms-header" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
        <tr><td height="36" style="font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
    </table>

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <table class="ms-content" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#2D5016;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;">
        <tr>
            <td style="padding:32px 40px 28px 40px;">
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="vertical-align:middle;">
                            <!-- Plataforma VERACIS — espelha a tela de login -->
                            <p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:'Rawline','Inter',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:400;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:0.2px;">
                                Plataforma <strong style="font-weight:700;color:#C8D97A;">VERACIS</strong>
                            </p>
                            <!-- Subtítulo em pill — igual ao da tela de login -->
                            <span style="display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-family:'Rawline','Inter',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.1px;">
                                Vulnerabilidades Étnico-Raciais, Ambiente, Clima e Impacto na Saúde
                            </span>
                        </td>
                        <td align="right" style="vertical-align:top;padding-left:20px;white-space:nowrap;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 3px 0;text-align:right;"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;">gov</span><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#FFCD07;">.br</span></p>
                            <p style="margin:0;font-size:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);text-align:right;line-height:1.4;">Ministério da Saúde</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr><td height="5" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#C8A96A 0%,#D4774A 50%,#4A8B6F 100%);font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
    </table>

    <!-- CORPO -->
    <table class="ms-content" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#FFFFFF;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
        <tr>
            <td class="ms-body" style="padding:40px 40px 36px 40px;">

                <!-- Ícone -->
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding-bottom:24px;">
                            <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="width:80px;height:80px;background-color:#FDF3E3;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border:3px solid #F0D9A8;">
                                        <span style="font-size:36px;line-height:74px;">🔑</span>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                <h1 style="margin:0 0 6px 0;color:#2D5016;font-size:26px;line-height:34px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;">Trocar minha senha</h1>
                <p style="color:#6B7B5E;margin:0 0 32px 0;font-size:15px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;">Recebemos o seu pedido. É rápido e fácil!</p>

                <p style="color:#333333;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:28px;">Olá, <strong style="color:#2D5016;">{{name}}</strong>!</p>

                <p style="color:#4a5566;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:28px;">
                    Você pediu para trocar a senha da conta vinculada ao e-mail <strong>{{emailMasked}}</strong>.
                </p>

                <p style="color:#4a5566;margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:28px;">
                    Clique no botão abaixo para criar uma senha nova. <strong>Este link é válido por {{expiresIn}}.</strong>
                </p>

                <!-- CTA -->
                <table width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding-bottom:28px;">
                            <table class="mobile-wide" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td align="center" style="background-color:#2D5016;border-radius:6px;">
                                        <a href="{{redirectUrl}}" target="_blank" style="background-color:#2D5016;padding:16px 40px;display:inline-block;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-family:'Rawline','Inter',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">🔒 &nbsp;Criar nova senha</a>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- Caixa "não fui eu" -->
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:20px 24px;border-radius:8px;background-color:#FDF8EC;border:1px solid #F0D9A8;border-left:5px solid #C8A96A;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#6B5B35;">❓ Não fui eu quem pediu isso</p>
                            <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#6B5B35;line-height:22px;">Sem problema — é só <strong>ignorar este e-mail</strong>. Sua senha atual continua a mesma e ninguém consegue acessar sua conta sem ela.</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- Aviso de segurança -->
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:32px;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:16px 20px;border-radius:8px;background-color:#FEF3F0;border-left:5px solid #D4774A;">
                            <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#7A3520;">
                                <strong>⚠ Atenção:</strong> O VERACIS e o Ministério da Saúde <strong>nunca</strong> ligam ou mandam mensagem pedindo sua senha. Se alguém pedir isso para você, é golpe.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                <p style="color:#4a5566;margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:26px;">
                    Equipe,<br>
                    <strong style="color:#2D5016;">Plataforma VERACIS</strong><br>
                    <span style="font-size:13px;color:#888888;">Ministério da Saúde</span>
                </p>

                <table width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:32px;">
                    <tr><td height="1" style="background-color:#E8E0D0;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
                </table>

                <p style="color:#999999;margin:18px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;">
                    Se o botão não funcionar, copie e cole o endereço abaixo no navegador (Chrome, Firefox, etc.):<br>
                    <span style="color:#2D5016;word-break:break-all;">{{redirectUrl}}</span>
                </p>

            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- RODAPÉ -->
    <table class="ms-footer" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#2D5016;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;">
        <tr><td height="5" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#C8A96A 0%,#D4774A 50%,#4A8B6F 100%);font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="padding:22px 40px;">
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding-bottom:6px;">
                            <span style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:1px;">VERA</span><span style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#C8A96A;letter-spacing:1px;">CIS</span>
                            <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);margin:0 8px;">·</span>
                            <span style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">Ministério da Saúde</span>
                            <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);margin:0 8px;">·</span>
                            <span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;">gov</span><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#FFCD07;">.br</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center">
                            <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);font-size:11px;">© {{year}} Governo Federal do Brasil. Todos os direitos reservados.</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
        <tr><td height="40" style="font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
    </table>

</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
